I've added a new guild roster system and character manager. You should see the links over to the left there <img src="./modules/PNphpBB2/images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="Smile" border="0" />.
<br />

<br />
When you edit your character if you fill in the First Name, Race, Class, Sex and Magelo ID you can then save it and on the screen that lists your characters there should be a link that says <span style="font-weight:bold">import</span>. Clicking that will import your character data from Magelo. This should make it easier for everyone to keep their characters up to date (assuming you remember to update Magelo, unlike me  <img src="./modules/PNphpBB2/images/smiles/icon_redface.gif" alt="Embarassed" border="0" /> ).
